Recommendation for Agentic AI

If you're learning AutoGen, CrewAI, LangGraph, or the OpenAI Agents SDK, these four are the most valuable to learn first:

Tavily API – Built specifically for AI agents and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).
Brave Search API – A strong general-purpose web search API with a free tier.
Exa API – Excellent for semantic search and AI-powered retrieval.
Serper API – Popular for accessing Google search results in AI applications.

These are the APIs you'll encounter most often in modern AI agent tutorials and real-world projects.

